HistoryStore ..> HistoryQuery : <<uses>>
HistoryStore ..> HistoryResult : <<uses>>
HistoryStore ..> HistoryRow : <<uses>>
HistoryStore ..> AlarmRecord : <<uses>>
AlarmEngine ..> AlarmRecord
AlarmRecord ..> Severity
DeviceInfo ..> Channel
DeviceInfo ..> ConnType
MainViewModel ..> HistoryQuery : <<uses>>
MainViewModel ..> HistoryResult : <<uses>>
HistoryPanel ..> HistoryResult : <<uses>>
HistoryPanel ..> MainViewModel : <<uses>>
MainWindow ..> MainViewModel : <<uses>>
MainWindow ..> Channel : <<uses>>
CurvePanel ..> Channel : <<uses>>
GaugeWidget ..> Channel : <<uses>>
HistoryPanel ..> Channel : <<uses>>
WriteRegisterDialog ..> DeviceInfo : <<uses>>

' ============================================================
' SIGNAL-SLOT CONNECTIONS
' ============================================================

IModbusClient --> DataCollector : connectionStateChanged\n→ onConnectionChanged
IModbusClient --> DataCollector : registersRead\n→ onRegistersRead
IModbusClient --> DataCollector : communicationError\n→ onCommError
IModbusClient --> DataCollector : writeSucceeded / writeFailed\n→ writeFinished(relay)

DataCollector --> SampleQueue : push (producer)
DataCollector --> HistoryStore : addSample / addAlarm
DataCollector --> AlarmEngine : checkValue
AlarmEngine --> HistoryStore : newAlarm → addAlarm
AlarmEngine --> MainViewModel : newAlarm
HistoryStore --> MainViewModel : samplesReady / alarmsReady
DataCollector --> MainViewModel : deviceConnectionChanged / deviceOnlineChanged\n/ statusMessage / writeFinished
DataCollector --> MainViewModel : configLoaded

MainViewModel --> DataCache : drainSamples → updateValue
DataCache --> MainWindow : devicesChanged → 重建硬件列表 + HistoryPanel::setDevices
DataCache --> MainWindow : currentDeviceChanged → 表格标题 + 曲线重建
DataCache --> MainWindow : valueChanged → CurvePanel::addPoint + DashboardPanel::updateValue
MainViewModel --> HistoryPanel : historySamplesReady / historyAlarmsReady
MainViewModel --> MainWindow : writeFinished → 状态栏

@enduml
